   "blurb": "Listed by Seiko Japan as new in its 2006–07 catalogue: 39.5 mm, sapphire crystal, 200 m, the 6R15 movement and an inner compass ring. The green SARB017 became one of the most talked-about Seikos of its era. The cream and black versions left the catalogue years before it did.",
   "lead": "sarb017"
  },
  {
